OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FThis morning will be cloudy
OL,6,Fwith widespread rain, heavy at times,
OL,7,FDrier and brighter weather with the
OL,8,Fodd shower will spread from the west
OL,9,Fthis afternoon. Strong southeasterly
OL,10,Fwinds along exposed parts of the east
OL,11,Fcoast.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FMainly dry this evening with
OL,14,Fjust the odd light shower. Then the
OL,15,Frest of the night will be largely dry
OL,16,Fwith some lengthy clear periods.
OL,17,
OL,18,CMonday:FAll parts will have a dry day
OL,19,Fwith some sunshine but high cloud
OL,20,Fspilling east later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
