OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FDry
OL,6,Fon Tuesday but rain spreading north,
OL,7,Fwindy with east coast gales later.
OL,8,FSunny spells and a few showers on
OL,9,FWednesday. Mostly dry and bright on
OL,10,FThursday.
